review_only = "JavaScript tests, HTTP exchanges, transaction Keccak hashing and Ed25519 verification are not executed by this Python-only gate. Source checks preserve the real producer-transcript loopback tests, success and reverted outcomes, wrong key ID and wrong public key refusals, exact requests and cleanup; runtime behavior and live node availability remain review-only here. No shell, unit or build file is repaired, so no shell parser or external toolchain is needed. These findings carry no restart/recovery change."
